d kantord    392 Sep  6 11:17 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    858 Sep  6 11:17 tests\n","metadata":{"output":"total 272\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    518 Sep  6 11:17 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    700 Sep  6 11:17 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord  13830 Sep  6 11:17 AGENTS.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     28 Sep  6 11:17 benches\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord  16512 Sep  6 11:17 build.rs\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord  14556 Sep  6 11:17 Cargo.lock\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    850 Sep  6 11:17 Cargo.toml\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     64 Sep  6 11:17 .claude\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    173 Sep  6 11:17 CLAUDE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   1688 Sep  6 11:17 clippy.toml\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   6295 Sep  6 11:17 CONTEXT.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     84 Sep  6 11:17 docs\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord 153838 Sep  6 11:17 draft.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   1975 Sep  6 11:17 ESCALATION.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    144 Sep  6 11:17 examples\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord     79 Sep  6 11:17 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord     38 Sep  6 11:17 .gitattributes\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     18 Sep  6 11:17 .github\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    188 Sep  6 11:17 .gitignore\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   1989 Sep  6 11:17 justfile\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    992 Sep  6 11:17 LAND-FAILURE.txt\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   7918 Sep  6 11:17 ONE_OFF_FIXES.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    813 Sep  6 11:17 opencode.jsonc\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord   2028 Sep  6 11:17 plans\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    394 Sep  6 11:17 prelude.toy\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   5062 Sep  6 11:17 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord   3658 Sep  6 11:17 research-log\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     18 Sep  6 11:17 runtime\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    326 Sep  6 11:17 site\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    392 Sep  6 11:17 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    858 Sep  6 11:17 tests\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"