{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788686300590,"sessionID":"ses_f89fe2701ffe6lTPBHqSpApZWe","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-994b73990b555e16","state":{"status":"error","input":{"url":"https://benchmarksgame-team.pages.debian.net/benchmarksgame/description/fasta.html"},"error":"The user rejected permission to use this specific tool call.","time":{"start":1788686300557,"end":1788686300587}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now, I need to understand the CLBG fasta task. Let me fetch the actual task description from the benchmarks game. Let me also understand what toylang language features are available (functions, recursion, stream, etc). \n\nLet me look at how a program builds up a string output. The binary-trees program outputs a single Int. Fasta needs to output a large text string (the DNA sequences). How does toylang output text? It prints the result value. For fasta, the result should be a big Str.\n\nLet me look at how strings are built and printed. Let me look at the corpus cases that output strings, e.g. str_concat.yaml, plus_concats.yaml.\n\nAlso, the bench harness feeds a single Int input and the program outputs its result (which hyperfine feeds to stdout). For fasta, the result must be the full text string printed.\n\nLet me look at the reference fasta algorithm and structure. Let me fetch the CLBG fasta task description.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_07602f36a001mtqWniRT2QRS9x","sessionID":"ses_f89fe2701ffe6lTPBHqSpApZWe","messageID":"msg_07602da05001aCzN9La4PcxXZ4"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788686301019,"sessionID":"ses_f89fe2701ffe6lTPBHqSpApZWe","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9c15a10cc19bbdeb","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-benchmark-fasta-build/tests/corpus/str_concat.yaml"},"output":"<path>/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-benchmark-fasta-build/tests/corpus/str_concat.yaml</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: program: |\n2:   \"n=\" + str(3)\n3: \n4: output: |\n5:   n=3\n6: \n7: node_types: [builtin.str, concat, int, str]\n\n(End of file - total 7 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"program: |\n  \"n=\" + str(3)\n\noutput: |\n  n=3\n\nnode_types: [builtin.str, concat, int, str]","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-benchmark-fasta-build/tests/corpus/str_concat.yaml","text":"program: |\n  \"n=\" + str(3)\n\noutput: |\n  n=3\n\nnode_types: [builtin.str, concat, int, str]","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":7,"totalLines":7,"truncated":false}},"title":"tests/corpus/str_concat.yaml","time":{"start":1788686301004,"end":1788686301018}},"id":"prt_07602f592001jCsY1OiPiqZVJD","sessionID":"ses_f89fe2701ffe6lTPBHqSpApZWe","messageID":"msg_07602da05001aCzN9La4PcxXZ4"}}
